            "paragraph": "The Mediterranean Basin is one of the regions most affected by climate change. Decreasing rainfall, rising air temperatures, decreasing soil moisture, increased evaporation, and prolonged drought periods put the region and its geographically indicated products at high risk (Lionello et al., 2014; Chmielewski and R\u00f6tzer, 2001).",
